  "text": "Emergency Vet & Specialty Hospital | SAGE Veterinary Centers\nSkip to Primary Content\nGive Us a Call\nEmergency\nEmergency\nContact Us\nContact Us\nWho We Are\nAbout Us\nGiving Back\nShare Your Story\nOur Team - Campbell\nOur Team - Concord\nOur Team - Dublin\nOur Team - Redwood City\nOur Team - San Francisco\nServices\nView all Services\nCampbell Services\nConcord Services\nDublin Services\nRedwood City Services\nSan Francisco Services\nFor Pet Owners\nFor Pet Owners\nSelf-Service Portal\nAppointment Information\nOnline Pharmacy\nGrief Support\nPet Owner FAQs\nFor Veterinarians\nFor Veterinarians\nE-Learning Portal\nClinical Trials\nRequest Records\nVeterinarian FAQs\nCareers\nGive Us a Call\nEmergency\nContact Us\nImproving the Lives of Pets and Their People\n• SAGE Veterinary Centers •\nFind a Location\nSAGE Veterinary Centers\nDEDICATED TO EXTRAORDINARY VETERINARY CARE IN THE BAY AREA\nSetting the highest standard of compassionate, collaborative veterinary care that improves the lives of pets and people. We are here because we appreciate and love animals. We will give pets and their families the best possible care with kindness and respect.\n24/7 Emergency Services\nWe’re there when you need us.\nSAGE provides emergency care in each of our hospitals, every day including holidays.\nOur emergency teams are comprised of seasoned doctors who have dedicated themselves to the field of emergency medicine.\nWhile emergency situations can be stressful, rest assured your pet will be in qualified hands.\nEmergency Services\nSelf-Service Portal\nWe’re happy to offer a self-service portal to help provide a more efficient overall experience for our pet owners.\nVisit The Portal\nJoin the SAGE Team\nOur community of hospitals are hiring. If you’re dedicated to provide top quality care for pets and pet parents, learn more an how to join our team.\nView Our Careers\nVeterinary Specialty Services\nOur SAGE Centers locations offer a variety of emergency and specialty services to provide the best care for you and your pet.\nSee All Services\nSelf-Service Portal\nWe’re happy to offer a self-service portal to help provide a more efficient overall experience for our pet owners.\nVisit The Portal\nJoin the SAGE Team\nOur community of hospitals are hiring. If you’re dedicated to provide top quality care for pets and pet parents, learn more an how to join our team.\nView Our Careers\nVeterinary Specialty Services\nOur SAGE Centers locations offer a variety of emergency and specialty services to provide the best care for you and your pet.\nSee All Services\nSelf-Service Portal\nWe’re happy to offer a self-service portal to help provide a more efficient overall experience for our pet owners.\nVisit The Portal\nJoin the SAGE Team\nOur community of hospitals are hiring. If you’re dedicated to provide top quality care for pets and pet parents, learn more an how to join our team.\nView Our Careers\nVeterinary Specialty Services\nOur SAGE Centers locations offer a variety of emergency and specialty services to provide the best care for you and your pet.\nSee All Services\nSelf-Service Portal\nWe’re happy to offer a self-service portal to help provide a more efficient overall experience for our pet owners.\nVisit The Portal\nAt SAGE Veterinary Centers, we understand that your pet is family. That’s why we’re committed to providing exceptional emergency and specialty care when your pet needs it most. With a team of highly trained specialists across disciplines like Surgery, Oncology, and Critical Care, we ensure every patient receives the individualized attention they deserve. Our hospitals are open 24/7 for emergencies, providing you with peace of mind and access to life-saving care around the clock.\nWhat sets SAGE apart is our focus on\ncontinuity of care.\nWith multiple specialties under one roof, your pet can seamlessly see a variety of experts in a single visit, ensuring a collaborative and efficient approach to treatment. This unique integration allows us to provide the highest level of care possible, tailored to your pet’s needs. At SAGE, we’re not just here for today — we’re here for every step of your pet’s healthcare journey.\nOur Veterinary Specialty Services\nAnesthesiology\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nDentistry\nEmergency\nEnd of Life Car\ne\nIntegrative Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nNeurology\nOncology\nOphthalmology\nPhysical Rehabilitation\nRadioactive Iodine Therapy\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nReferring DVM\nWant to know more about SAGE Veterinary Centers?\nSign up for our Newsletter to learn more and stay up to date!\nSign Up For Our Newsletter\nFind a Location\nServices\nSelf-Service Portal\nOnline Pharmacy\nContact Us\nEmergency\n©\nCopyright\n2026\nTerms & Conditions\nAccessibility\nPrivacy Policy\nCareers\nCookie Preferences\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
